{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1272,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6903d1ff134bb6c80ce24929",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪白色的……\n感觉很轻快……",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d86fcf8f1e80f7279c6acfd64d21eca97a2523da9bbd0150025ab7d5f3d7d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aeb708076f049044bbe2cbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在舞台上绽放光辉，\n蕴含着不可思议的力量的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45f22210fb43e2ccd2a107ab0d7c974a36ff716514d24cfbae180760fff303e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a05614cdcb7d079c6d3675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……果然，我很中意这个颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd36cfb8eb324306d5d0855cc1826748dd2f52ade1ac1de7de6668328f1fdc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95186896ce336700a81d7682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着很舒服……\n又整洁、又清爽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e6848d319ceb8b81642e34bffef64859a267c5ff16ecbbc28e3e0611a8e67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acfa30b53f8b3c4e46b145fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我起舞的时候，影子也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b3a3dc7a59fa49a1f6940b4a1c22085b19863972d9b30292554532e0292870",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2b93f5b72dc37d39636f978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚、黑暗、那道影子……\n我喜欢的东西，都是这个颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60103161a24f4e3a915f02b508b3dca0423bd0cfd37e8c6b80845cf2b37d267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54224ea63d8b04380549f87f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ、大切な人とのひとときを…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88500450b6dd9522216dfc707e7dd0aed26f6132b96742eb762954d36babd6c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5b2b52fce52b80a31c5b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコの名札は、\r\n食べてはいけませんよ…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebad595c7a9043afb8261b25a0cf32143aa9a3cc156e655ef48d7f6691a67f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9d10f622abab3072b59c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听见了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a09fa7eae8d5a393feba5133c0b81343a65fed2dec4b44c5b1c15b97048267d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd2facaa2ecb4e1163382b0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定……要追上那个影子……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a856b902e9ed8ff93fd49f7aa752e174a9c1ef178bc1eca192990d801691b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc169b38e960f0f81124403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55b9173b1cbb4412eb641581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…迷い込んだのですか？\r\n出口は…さて、\r\nどちらでしょう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8b7cebbeea1e030b6a56335234dc525ffa8b7ac5ab274af5658567b42fb0bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dc9d6f12e5d3cfd6025789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自ら茨の道へ…？\r\nわかりました、\r\nそういうことなら…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37cdf70c6aef28e6e0ca21b572d5f0cde2f48bcd3fed6c489eee61bfe108c2c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3045810f94616b60049e036e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……早上好。\n……要喝一杯能让您精神抖擞的咖啡吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7c33470b509cccd245b4bfc70b8a0a6c4e04e6739e23ac16eeabcd696b4502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd82141c62fcf73d28711c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タキオンさんの実験にしては、\r\n比較的安全…とのことです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d43608143b4559bb58070539f85ddbb3a0a5f1f4753f3a754dbbe824ef2b76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84239c6e41bc1e82beb7d798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巻き込まれる人数が多いのは、\r\n考えものですが…賑やかなのも、\r\nたまには…悪くありませんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef8bf8f8310dfb0ffe3363d74d1fffb3fbd61f023ee5473c28e757f639c41028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:114defbad119c32f9235bcb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "謝礼の品…だそうです。\r\n直接言えばいいのに…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afafffce9b3f41912a2e9aed5397753d50027ca094ea998f666e690e3a41232c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3402345742118b085f31d75a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タキオンさんを疑う気持ちは\r\nわかりますが…。成果物はいつも\r\n本物です。一応…保証します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7418370afa0691328ca5b27e01080e7b066363d97bb0d9100e9f5b9cd6cca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3c341c307045323d24e32a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "己をひたむきに研究し、問題は\r\n1つずつ克服する…その姿自体は、\r\nまあ…評価されてもよいかと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf59a11a6db4e3116c59405ddd4a3fef2fd38c4afb1f4fd3cb4611a6dc6319a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a51ee2fd9640f7f62c3681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実験は失敗が常…その積み重ねが\r\n成功へつながる…。タキオンさんも\r\nたまにはいいことを言いますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d3b7f79562ab704046dd6cdcf01b2cfa83998014e06f7b2d23b9889d51df92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f09334c47bef338755ef3b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲸鱼生出七彩的翅膀，\n在青金石般的天空中遨游……\n呵呵，梦的世界真是有趣啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb361dca8999e85e0e21cff35bb39e4d1459180b56917d3b5a2adf289557563f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:582650cf7d14060fa4d11008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……您好。\n……阳光真是刺眼呢。\n比起太阳，我更愿意委身于北风啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84df1f21f79fbce76ce1b19736fc754f22d410e21e137d0dcd4ed931692671a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f97780bab019a83705cae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得在白天使不上劲……\n训练也安排在日落之后更好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5719adb4d59bcd78ddf8678404d8b8d2b8682699e68b6d6a26af308891d89b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bcff391e1c964cc15a520a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到晚上了呢……\n与另一个世界的境界线也变得模糊了……\n您听……有声音……",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c07175851de976b2500c9dad5f94a042925320d4893fa722bd48a8f5c5f7e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dccac45e302f720a452e865",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "獏是吞噬噩梦的生物。\n这样的话，说不定我也会碰上它们呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2ff7136207fca2e2d988a208e700401470bf2ff142d43455a1862cc2677e0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627cdea001cb716a9b6f1612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山蕨……荚果蕨……紫萁……\n在这个季节都冒出新芽了……\n……看上去很惹人怜爱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "329d9a8c4c2c22db545138b137e21f6cc2474fdcfad51056c501cfed8313d634",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8df23c18e6221ad48cc91d0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光越是耀眼，\n影子看上去也越是浓重……\n感觉比平时更加接近了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6839d672edf57d19703962ef1fa026e53a5b423076df2be334ce45356d2e7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ab69901a6897c45619915e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是个很适合登山的季节呢……\n单手拿着提灯，慢慢品味夜晚的寂静……\n是种足以称得上奢侈的享受……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d8b45e394460d025b26f809fd2771f9af9bba0293a74c0fe58e927680b40d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43c7c730f9a50a7d0f389c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪花纷纷飘落……\n仿佛是黑白的万华镜中窥见的景色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2cac3d33845703dc76848ec4afd6a82640279feccf376c98069fe5ea702eae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da83da2ca7dde05d45e0a689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和菓子と共に、心穏やかな朝を…。\r\nたまには、そのようなひとときも\r\nよろしいかと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17daef74dd0cb462ac45c2f9a4fdf46611ab1f826817bb48ef1f40d969651cba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6cc69e3e82d5cdf1bb6cae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "渋い玉露で、朝食を…。\r\n珈琲以外で朝を迎えるのも…\r\nほっとしますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c838e099f203963bf633dabaa0d966d66f6e4dd4ca0306476e56750a742d391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e544bbfee89fe0ce09d5448",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "授業中、ポッケさんがうとうとして\r\nいたので…眠気覚ましに、珈琲を。\r\n水筒に入れて持ってきているんです",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b13834f4bf480879dd73456ef42bbd3f917db28c5a27f4d67432ce13334201b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c79a228e15e4dc164b099b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後のおやつはお済みですか…？\r\n猫のお饅頭、耳の形をこだわったら\r\n…作り過ぎてしまって…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "220c6e835e04dcb3e37d2d245f449b1fe5c7d5be9c30f102b422994e2bfd4c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb50dc1b45ed4fa2547a64b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星屑は金平糖、お月様は\r\n黄身しぐれ…。晴れの日の夜空は…\r\n和菓子でいっぱい、です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10faced97c4d30816cea788eeb44357311c0ea4e2850fc237aa7c7a5c22aa6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851b31a3521db5a3ba21b4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜の和カフェは、お伽噺の世界…。\r\n幻想的な月明かりの庭園を、\r\nいつまでも眺めてしまいます…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf402a913325ba085f47ebbe777b0353e15f54da085ccfe0642a73802b6ba65e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:915f83a03b94346fff73149b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『SAKURA抹茶カプチーノ』――\r\n甘さと苦さが調和した、あの奥深い\r\n味わいは…おすすめ、です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb0824308048c9fd1e2bb3545c4598243b2592ca3196e4d074a9bfd492453a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade2d8dfb1ed5d992b2b2b8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祭りの季節は、散歩をよくします…\r\n夏の夜空を彩る万華鏡を、\r\n独り占めできる場所を求めて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f916935b54d006a05b2870053caa1e3a2200adb52fbc5678614f3f0a81b29955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e56966be606d165ef392073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『いらっしゃいませ』…ふふ、\r\n接客の仕方も、聖蹄祭で\r\nすっかり身につきました…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "696c9d9ecbf996535bcf89424f174b6554d50bb9a51d38356934771d7a102dbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6642238fe4328b5105c574d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かまくらは、無彩色の殻…。\r\n冷たくて薄暗い、心落ち着く場所…\r\nよければ、お試しを…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d284f27c979d3efe0bf3236322911342059a8976a0c9ef9649ab19d5e36ea4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197e8b27c0ca51fc6c6462ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6286e7515e45ee73edfb6ac96e24de5e1bedc073e7fc40ecca5a2b6af533c60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3974e5b762d37f9e1c937663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6286e7515e45ee73edfb6ac96e24de5e1bedc073e7fc40ecca5a2b6af533c60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a4e64117c44e6c06aa329e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么评价速子同学吗……？\n……『诡骗师』。\n这个词就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf45686187ac003c01946d64e2ccae04b6f3ebcd71dbbe7fbe2f2409e92e78b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e3d1426429acdf309f0a3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我泡咖啡的时候……\n小雪同学就会烤曲奇出来一起吃……\n真是位如摇篮一般温柔的人呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28afd9255ebbc58a2f984c72f26ea01dd18689d1221969e7908ba2d4b1728dde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67977c4ccb434e94c67a50e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "错觉也是知觉的一种……\n这样想的话，不管看见什么\n都不会觉得奇怪了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e3d30fdd8a052a511ec3fe86aa37031ca9a663302f1d555506209d1362910f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f5b00db679a923c7f884e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海拔越高，越能培育出好咖啡豆……\n以山的名字命名咖啡豆，\n也是这个原因……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d4d195111dc43877cd66419848bebe5a62dcce9661278831aa9eecac21908f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f4de48bf7e0aa6922c10fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人鱼终会化作泡沫回归大海……\n赛马娘也会变作飞尘，\n归于大地吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1dc7fa8cbcd81010c6c334875fe84a4e1460641bd220703827c8c17937306f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5ac1577c3164a2a16ac407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "翩翩飘舞……投影摇曳……\n我倒是不讨厌翩翩起舞的衣物之影呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "59dec2a8591efe848610634db889f5567882b1bb7a3e52eea44adedf4fd304a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ce31ecaaa3d4e3fbf0d2d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台上灯光太过明亮、太过刺眼……\n要是能再暗一些就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c4dd2202a82093813e257db9817b82f4059495993862965954ad002864140c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa8460c364445aa34d7fe05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服就像咖啡一般漆黑而深邃……\n穿着它就能静下心来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98fe3d59b446d29e484b95ba5942ada0e9c4cd734b14d269887cd17f7d415ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a34dc3cbff458a32b4f002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少种颜色混合起来，都只会变成黑色……\n黑色……是能够吞噬一切、接受一切的颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94aa4c27da0bb1dc719d3859725f3084d3e1fdd59a3b7e90c726d6ba21b18035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:704683e8e8a1614ea585c5d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起磨咖啡豆的时间……\n是独属于我的、宝贵的时间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b766e18f58d5fe5aff49b49977fe292cc22e6470f5feeb6f9d43fd9d30c414",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cace8ea6435440c4f3175906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂的咖啡丝毫不逊色于外面咖啡店的咖啡……\n不过因为食堂人太多，很难抢到呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0b6029cf2c39caf841159302cb20cafeda4507c55b9e5f3c7932a51dda90e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ae4105c177a435eaa5c271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…迷い込んだのですか？\r\n出口は…さて、\r\nどちらでしょう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8b7cebbeea1e030b6a56335234dc525ffa8b7ac5ab274af5658567b42fb0bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b09122c9c21edf5fc7e8f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我找到了神灯的话，\n我会许下这样的心愿……\n『就让我永远身处夜幕之中』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "45d0b121600c132c0d277898ca77502735280152f7a5da5880ce94c11ec8bb23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017b7ada25a954bcbd7420df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在樱花树下――\n哦呀？您想到了什么呢？\n……请告诉我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0eb4e7d781ed31eff72603b6109c2e6d8dc7a9ac3a80ead53bfa60a3917161",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0460bc9fef05e353a151afab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雨落个不停……蜗牛也爬出来了呢……\n我也……喜欢像它们这样待在壳里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5272df14f82a4b561872e64d3208e7cd5d58729fff4d950f1c0464dadb473f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de6610f1760a6a55166a57c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小小的红色手掌浮现在地面上，\n不断变多、不断变多……\n……对。我说的是红叶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fec111ff8f9f1570e56005e34926dcf6f083624592e5805a3535b5a9f010b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907262aa8006f6dff6914f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着水晶球的话，\n就会觉得心情畅快……\n只要不把玻璃打破的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5c06846e5b6a608ec8bbff7019c989cc27a799abc692513a7d3f733db00074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3577c225785c57299710e9b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ポッケさんとタキオンさん、最後の\r\n苺大福を取り合ってしまって…。\r\n均等に分け合えばいいのに…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6e634f6ed631fcecc1f6608e8a123b8e8239795a06dc4535914ca7653329b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74077f557c119d01123a9dbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『あなたならガーリー系！』と、\r\nフライトさんに指南を受けまして…\r\nお洒落は奥が深い、のですね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea235988f4a678d41aa1c5de0241ee4b55e6b269203c708f9b6a277417547cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a555236daa543d1e61d54426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バクシンオーさんが、髪が伸びる\r\n人形を…成長期なのですね、と…。\r\nふふ…太陽のような方です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a771bc9e1e8cf707235cc18c2e2282a9260ad12ac866810b9350145d435c65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0598d362a76dcc911efb2dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『全力で登山をしようよ！』…と、\r\nチケットさんに誘われて…。限界を\r\n越えた景色に、辿り着けるかも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b04ff116e0d89e20e02f109f1b683703ebafae30141170cc32553381d896058",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d96d00a7ba2013cbd1f84c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メルヘンなお菓子を作ると、弟や\r\n妹たちが喜んでくれて…。見た目を\r\n凝ったレシピは、今でも覚えてます",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7c2fd1a381c169cdd573b14eddcb4fe893e9c3ad9f03ae9f60fb9fd09fbae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db3c26a04d977dc2a88d8d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝、夢で見た純白の月光花…。\r\nアナタに見せたいくらい、綺麗で…\r\n和菓子で再現できないでしょうか…",
      "source_fingerprint": "744856f226b76faa46a73915614a298fa07e245291f13234df9c5a62e010199b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0244cdc4cdd990a8a2d4d5da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスンは…タップさんと、\r\nバロックダンスを。欧州の踊りは…\r\n少しだけ、興味があります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab885b1a94e5ee8a0b8fdc2290c85e8bcd8a9e5762660be82b32e66913e7f92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a2275e36069fc42ff16300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お風呂の後は、髪を乾かすのが\r\n大変で…。チヨノオーさんが、\r\n手伝ってくれることも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "496272e6778d6032d9c69662bd9850ae9759c4283a5b6a7219b92c7712b48394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afbf122bf9b323ae8733fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "満開の桜並木で走り込み…清々しい\r\n気持ち、でした。誘ってくれた\r\nローレルさんには、感謝です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bfde18d38983a38d73366a549f63d791c18b021c8a78aeb62bd3ca17b2254d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d7cede5fe19d6e27f8108a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニヴァースさんと、夏空を眺めて\r\nいたら…『“GRMS”だね』、と。\r\n不思議と、胸が温かく…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d54993dae18699fac9839ab510805566d35496becf040dcc5676bf18f871f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:778b647f378e9a86f0e5b7cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋はよく…絵筆をとります。\r\n目に映るこの愛しい世界を、\r\n永遠に閉じ込めたくて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec6f1e674e7d9289867b997076cf1ddfe9de55531944f778e36164bbefa24c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba5f6a6c484339f8fd102c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノさんの作るおしるこは…\r\n冬の寒さを溶かすような、\r\n甘く優しく…温かな味でした…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61de4120ea9edaba471efd70b689ba93d80cbe5e00fea68f70be7c835293fd8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617a697807eb65d7111f2b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装を着ていると、不思議と\r\n猫が集まってきて…。今度、\r\n猫用のケーキを作りましょうか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5478e478ce37137757b2aca804e0d0655fe93862df3d5e998757fb6f36dd56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a7381048e1af9d13a73f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この三つ編みは…ユキノさんが、\r\n丁寧に編んでくれて…。\r\n鏡があると、つい…見てしまいます",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb30828073cecc34581f66b3595f234700cb975e9f592edad53353998a547a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4375029a41013f886b656a1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请您关照了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3395d14eae755831a2fbb1eba405ec27dcbcf417e10f097c9d10554def9ef9d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959d684e55cea0d074eb30e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04353b27949712113f95ab86d04897462dbe0ce31a97b8de04ef417a8e5a13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa6626520121a6e2e77d381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了追上那个身影……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6456d29c847dbe2bd7246a7c403555e7cd16f2723d4da45dd6c2c69262d63ff4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310bb68e38a71e6a9b111dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯，就这样吧。\n就像以前一样，一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1fc55864471a61f907406ee02e0fa7f7c0796013b2d8a7fdbc63dbea36ff61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4971a72f92974e983efc3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪里呢……\n要一直追逐着那只青鸟，\n直到远方吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcce65c713bc91dfd4fc213275559a625712e9ae5d23347a176561b8c3398bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b7e503d967c71ecea072cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚，您的影子突然自己动了——\n……呵呵，说笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd3105bc76af7e284bbc602946b58af19962fe9121cbfe57734cd5e375b71a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89866edf5f320f8ca0021680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在那道身影彻底跑远之前，\n必须要追上她……必须……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6825f248275a8f0fb90e61b43003209e03cba81d72ab94dacfafe2e4ace42913",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab3268ce3f97135ed65ae21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月兔永远都孑然一身……\n而我……还有您，和那位朋友……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c25face8a0a80fd2bb0c14a0f11cd0667220a0091837c7f09821d45ce36cc7d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
